{"ID":2916,"post_author":"0","post_date":"2026-05-21 15:41:20","post_date_gmt":"2026-05-21 15:41:20","post_content":"<div class=\"dc-error-page\"><div class=\"dc-error-page__kicker\">Gre\u0161ka u procesu<\/div><p class=\"dc-error-page__lead\">Presjek izgleda mutno, mast nije jasno odvojena od mesa, a struktura djeluje mazivo i neuredno.<\/p><figure class=\"dc-error-page__infographic\"><a href=\"https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/drycured\/infografike-greske-web\/web\/chatgpt-image-18-svi-2026-21-21-12.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https:\/\/drycured.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/drycured\/infografike-greske-web\/web\/chatgpt-image-18-svi-2026-21-21-12.webp\" alt=\"Razmazana mast u presjeku\"><\/a><figcaption>Razmazana mast u presjeku<\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"dc-error-page__grid\"><section><h2>Naj\u010de\u0161\u0107i uzrok<\/h2><p>Naj\u010de\u0161\u0107i uzrok je pretoplo meso ili slanina tijekom rezanja, mljevenja ili mije\u0161anja.<\/p><\/section><section><h2>\u0160to odmah napraviti<\/h2><p>Zaustaviti rad, vratiti masu na hla\u0111enje i provjeriti o\u0161trinu no\u017eeva, plo\u010de mlina i temperaturu smjese.<\/p><\/section><section><h2>\u0160to ne raditi<\/h2><p>Ne nastavljati mljevenje ili mije\u0161anje tople mase jer se problem obi\u010dno samo pogor\u0161ava.<\/p><\/section><section><h2>Povezana faza procesa<\/h2><p>Ova gre\u0161ka naj\u010de\u0161\u0107e je povezana s fazom: <strong>Mljevenje<\/strong>.<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/drycured.com\/proces-izrade\/mljevenje\/\">Otvori povezanu fazu<\/a><\/p><\/section><\/div><div class=\"dc-error-page__nav\"><a href=\"https:\/\/drycured.com\/greske\/\">Sve gre\u0161ke<\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/drycured.com\/\">Po\u010detna<\/a><\/div><\/div>","post_title":"Razmazana mast u presjeku","post_excerpt":"","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","post_password":"","post_name":"razmazana-mast-u-presjeku","to_ping":"","pinged":"","post_modified":"